# Admin checkboxes

Owner preference: native checkboxes in admin must use project styling — black / primary accent, not browser default blue.

## Use

```tsx
import { adminCheckbox } from "@/lib/admin-ui-classes";

<input type="checkbox" className={adminCheckbox} ... />
```

Defined in `frontend/src/lib/admin-ui-classes.ts` (`accent-admin-primary`).

## Do not

- Leave bare `<input type="checkbox">` without `adminCheckbox` in admin UI
- Invent a one-off accent color for checkboxes
